IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `mrha-harmony`

-- Maintenance of Religious Harmony Act 1990, ss 2, 8, 9, 11, 12, 16, 16A, 16D, 16E, 17D, 17E, 17F, 17H and 17J -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_maintenance-of-religious-harmony-act-1990.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

