§ `s 2 -- relevant donors and foreign principals`

#ASSERT NOT `the donor is a relevant donor` `a resident prescribed as a permissible donor`
#ASSERT NOT `the donor is a relevant donor` `a Singapore-registered entity based abroad`

#ASSERT `the donor is a foreign principal` `a resident prescribed as a permissible donor`
#ASSERT `the donor is a foreign principal` `a Singapore-registered entity based abroad`

